# ARC-Bench backend Playwright E2E tests will be created here by the agent.

This directory exists because ``template/template.yaml`` advertises
``backend/test-e2e`` as the canonical ``e2e_test_root`` and Playwright's
``playwright.config.js`` resolves ``testDir`` against the backend working
directory. Removing this directory would break ``npm run test:e2e`` from
finding any test files.